00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.000
My favorite performer this week though: 

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.520
Danielle Panabaker---hands down---as Caitlin Snow.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:54.180
She was a force...of...nature.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:06:01.560
She's rapidly outpacing Felicity Smoke as my favorite female character in the DC/Arrow universe on TV right now.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:06.720
To be fair though, Danielle Panabaker has been one of my favorite like, 'genre actresses' for a long time.

