00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:23.798
TECHNICALLY the Flash is faster than Superman, but that's ONLY because he can break the laws of physics.

00:07:23.798 --> 00:07:28.048
I know it sounds silly, but the Speed Force is the reason why he isn't subject to friction.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.580
All in all, great episode.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.480
